            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Nvidia's Jensen Huang pushes back on AI job fears, claims AI is creating enormous number of jobs",
            "articleSection": "Job Evolution",
            "abstract": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang publicly disputed widespread fears that AI is a net job killer, arguing instead that AI is generating a large number of new roles. His comments come as worker anxiety about AI-driven displacement is near an all-time high globally. Critics note that Huang's position as head of the world's leading AI chip company creates a significant conflict of interest in making such assessments.",
            "url": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/04/as-workers-worry-about-ai-nvidias-jensen-huang-says-ai-is-creating-an-enormous-number-of-jobs/",
